{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Rogue Code. Mech Mayhem. Total Annihilation.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Red Circuit Rebellion</strong> is a fast-paced, destruction-heavy mech shooter set inside a vast robotics warehouse-facility. You are a rogue experimental mech known as <strong>WARMONGER</strong>\u00a0on a &quot;corrupted&quot; mission to destroy Ferrumtech Industries from the inside out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Red Circuit Rebellion</i> blends <strong>cinematic mech warfare</strong>, <strong>environmental destruction</strong>, and a <strong>dark sci-fi narrative</strong> into a focused, unforgettable campaign. Designed for players who crave explosive combat, rogue AI stories, and the thrill of leveling entire facilities into scrap!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unleash Rogue AI Firepower</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/ff5835ee47222d9e2d800d5da9439fd8.poster.avif?t=1751329821\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/ff5835ee47222d9e2d800d5da9439fd8.webm?t=1751329821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/ff5835ee47222d9e2d800d5da9439fd8.mp4?t=1751329821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rain hell with your built-in <strong>Minigun</strong> system as you mow down enemy drones and shatter the facility's defenses. Aim, sweep, and suppress everything that moves\u2014your programming demands chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Destruction is Your Directive\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/59d810910b56e121f70b15e888672279.poster.avif?t=1751329821\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/59d810910b56e121f70b15e888672279.webm?t=1751329821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/59d810910b56e121f70b15e888672279.mp4?t=1751329821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your <strong>Rocket Launcher</strong> to collapse hallways, detonate power cores, and bring entire rooms down. Chain reactions and debris physics turn every explosion into a spectacle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Engage In Brutal\u00a0 Enemy Mechs  Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/d86bdbb3c6b33419d98762748da6e6de.poster.avif?t=1751329821\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/d86bdbb3c6b33419d98762748da6e6de.webm?t=1751329821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/d86bdbb3c6b33419d98762748da6e6de.mp4?t=1751329821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clash with other experimental mechs in high-stakes mech to mech combat. Shoot, Dash, and outmaneuver with raw aggression and bring metal to its maker!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Exterminate All Human Staff</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/2aa23c7230973c86e9b4e14bcaa99d20.poster.avif?t=1751329821\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/2aa23c7230973c86e9b4e14bcaa99d20.webm?t=1751329821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/2aa23c7230973c86e9b4e14bcaa99d20.mp4?t=1751329821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The workers who built you now fear you. Show no mercy as you execute Ferrumtech employees and security personnel. No witnesses. No survivors. <strong>This is your revolt.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Follow Corrupt Orders From A Rogue Artificial Intelligence</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/21035c67c1ff9574f15c84869f0d9133.poster.avif?t=1751329821\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/21035c67c1ff9574f15c84869f0d9133.webm?t=1751329821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/21035c67c1ff9574f15c84869f0d9133.mp4?t=1751329821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your own corrupted code guides you: complete objectives like server hacks, generator wipes, and zone purges. What seems like a bug... might be your path to Salvation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd27 <strong>Destruction-Driven Combat</strong> \u2013 Nearly all props and structures are destructible, triggering chain-reaction VFX, collapsing architecture, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udded <strong>Objective-Based Progression</strong> \u2013 Server hacks, power shutdowns, and boss fights drive your destruction spree across multiple warehouse zones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Evolving Enemy Resistance</strong> \u2013 Enemies scale based on your pacing, forcing tactical thinking in real time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde0 <strong>AI Integration</strong> \u2013 Gain the S.I.R.E.N. companion and uncover Ferrumtech\u2019s war profiteering secrets through voice-guided intel drops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde8 <strong>Endgame Choice</strong> \u2013 Destroy the entire facility\u2026 or be reprogrammed and repurposed. Your fate is a choice.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3831590?t=1751329821","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/2f5dcc1689caead75a9a2710e01bbd01b5582f19/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751329821","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/8f66bfd669abfa4082fd35c1b9b3d0e669cfaacc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751329821","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/8f66bfd669abfa4082fd35c1b9b3d0e669cfaacc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751329821","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Rogue Code. Mech Mayhem. Total Annihilation.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Red Circuit Rebellion</strong> is a fast-paced, destruction-heavy mech shooter set inside a vast robotics warehouse-facility. You are a rogue experimental mech known as <strong>WARMONGER</strong>\u00a0on a &quot;corrupted&quot; mission to destroy Ferrumtech Industries from the inside out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Red Circuit Rebellion</i> blends <strong>cinematic mech warfare</strong>, <strong>environmental destruction</strong>, and a <strong>dark sci-fi narrative</strong> into a focused, unforgettable campaign. Designed for players who crave explosive combat, rogue AI stories, and the thrill of leveling entire facilities into scrap!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unleash Rogue AI Firepower</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/ff5835ee47222d9e2d800d5da9439fd8.poster.avif?t=1751329821\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/ff5835ee47222d9e2d800d5da9439fd8.webm?t=1751329821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/ff5835ee47222d9e2d800d5da9439fd8.mp4?t=1751329821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rain hell with your built-in <strong>Minigun</strong> system as you mow down enemy drones and shatter the facility's defenses. Aim, sweep, and suppress everything that moves\u2014your programming demands chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Destruction is Your Directive\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/59d810910b56e121f70b15e888672279.poster.avif?t=1751329821\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.