le based on your pacing, forcing tactical thinking in real time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde0 <strong>AI Integration</strong> \u2013 Gain the S.I.R.E.N. companion and uncover Ferrumtech\u2019s war profiteering secrets through voice-guided intel drops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde8 <strong>Endgame Choice</strong> \u2013 Destroy the entire facility\u2026 or be reprogrammed and repurposed. Your fate is a choice.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Derek Wicks","Akshar Vandara","Clara Owens","Ira Villaruel","Logan Fredericksen","Matthew Garwin","Marcus Thinn","Dominic Smith"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/58e0a3a51e7a84d3b16514bbba4cb7715a1d107a/header.jpg?t=1751329821","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Otisco Studios. All rights reserved.<br />\r\nOtisco Studios\u2122 and all associated game titles, logos, characters, and assets are trademarks or registered trademarks of Otisco Studios in the United States, Canada, the European Union, and other jurisdictions. Unauthorized reproduction, modification, distribution, or resale of this software or its components is strictly prohibited and may result in legal action under applicable intellectual property laws.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Not Officially supported</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Not Officially Supported</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Red Circuit Rebellion","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 or AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</st